%% Diagram 1: Aletheia Architecture Flow
graph TD
    classDef main fill:#2c3e50,stroke:#34495e,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;
    classDef process fill:#3498db,stroke:#2980b9,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;
    classDef output fill:#27ae60,stroke:#2ecc71,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;

    Q[User Query]:::main --> SR[Semantic Routing Engine]:::process
